      "writtenOn": "2025-04-28T19:12:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we need to zero these bytes at this point, there\u0027s still the possibility that another `append()` call will come along and provide valid data for these indices. Does it not work to have `pad()` also handle zeroing the data in the vertex writer that it gets?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 338,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "3506a82ddd35d9fce353d2feb113bfdaa8053915",
